 "description": "DiamondNIC and DiamondLINK provide a cost-effective and flexible end-to-end network security solution for the LAN, WAN, or Internet. They not only provide a high level of trust and data separation through the established end-to-end session, they additionally provide added levels of security by bringing firewall filtering functionality to the desktop. These modules provide strong I&A and user selectable/dynamically downloaded security policies to the desktop.",
